 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Regalia — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>Your very soul has become a cursed tool that has been sealed within. You have the ability to manifest it using cursed energy.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you can manifest your Regalia as an action for 2 CE for a number of hours equal to your Cursed Energy modifier. Your Regalia takes the form of a simple or martial melee weapon of your choice, such as Dagger or a Shortsword. You are proficient with the weapon and gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls using your Regalia. Once per turn on a hit you can spend 1 CE to deal an additional 1d8 necrotic damage. This becomes 2d8 at 3rd level, 3d8 at 6th level, 4d8 at 11th level and 6d8 at 18th level.<br />\n Your Regalia disappears if it is more than 30 feet away from you and cannot be wielded by other creatures.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
